---
// Preview: Aerospace & Mission-Critical Structural Docket
const pageTitle = "Cristian Dulcey — Mission Architecture // High-Reliability Systems";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>{pageTitle}</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #07090e;
      --panel: #0d111a;
      --panel-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      --panel-border-amber: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
      --amber: #f59e0b;
      --amber-dim: #b45309;
      --amber-bg: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08);
      --titanium: #f1f5f9;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --text-dim: #64748b;
      --font-display: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
      --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--titanium);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      padding-bottom: 5rem;
    }

    /* Top Mission Telemetry Bar */
    .mission-bar {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
      background: rgba(13, 17, 26, 0.95);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 50;
    }
    .mission-indicator {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      color: var(--amber);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }
    .status-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      background: var(--amber);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .mission-coords {
      color: var(--text-dim);
      display: none;
    }
    @media (min-width: 640px) {
      .mission-coords { display: block; }
    }

    /* Container */
    .container {
      max-width: 1080px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 1.25rem;
    }

    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      padding: 3.5rem 0 2.5rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
    }
    .docket-stamp {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--amber);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
      background: var(--amber-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border-amber);
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 7vw, 4.5rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .hero-title span {
      color: var(--amber);
    }
    .hero-lead {
      font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.5vw, 1.35rem);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 720px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    /* Specification Strip */
    .spec-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .spec-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
    }
    .spec-box {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1.25rem;
      position: relative;
    }
    .spec-box::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 2px;
      background: transparent;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .spec-box:hover::before {
      background: var(--amber);
    }
    .spec-label {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      display: block;
    }
    .spec-value {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #ffffff;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .spec-sub {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 0.25rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
    }

    /* Section Styling */
    .section-title-wrap {
      margin: 4rem 0 2rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      justify-content: space-between;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
      padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
    .section-num {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--amber);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* Dossier Cards */
    .dossier-card {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .dossier-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--panel-border-amber);
    }
    .dossier-header {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
      padding-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .dossier-code {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--amber);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }
    .dossier-name {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin-top: 0.25rem;
    }
    .dossier-tags {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .dossier-tag {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
      border-radius: 4px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }
    .dossier-body {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .dossier-body { grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr; }
    }
    .dossier-text p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .dossier-specs-box {
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 1.25rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }
    .spec-line {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0.4rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    }
    .spec-line:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .spec-k { color: var(--text-dim); }
    .spec-v { color: #ffffff; font-weight: 600; }

    /* Advisory Callout */
    .advisory-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.05) 0%, rgba(13, 17, 26, 0.9) 100%);
      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border-amber);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      margin-top: 4rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .advisory-box h3 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .advisory-box p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
    .btn-action {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      background: var(--amber);
      color: #000000;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: transform 0.15s, opacity 0.15s;
    }
    .btn-action:hover {
      opacity: 0.9;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    /* Switcher Navigation */
    .preview-nav {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 1rem;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: rgba(13, 17, 26, 0.95);
      border: 1px solid var(--amber);
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 50px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
      z-index: 100;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
    }
    .preview-nav a {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      transition: color 0.15s;
    }
    .preview-nav a.active {
      background: var(--amber);
      color: #000000;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Telemetry Bar -->
  <header class="mission-bar">
    <div class="mission-indicator">
      <span class="status-dot"></span>
      <span>MISSION ARCHITECTURE // ENVELOPE: PROD</span>
    </div>
    <div class="mission-coords">
      COORDINATES: LATAM / GLOBAL INFRASTRUCTURE · SLA 99.999%
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="docket-stamp">ARCHITECTURAL DOSSIER // CRISTIAN DULCEY</div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">High-Reliability Systems Architecture for <span>Sovereign Scale</span>.</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">
        Senior Systems Architect, Google Developer Expert (GDE) y Microsoft MVP. Diseño e implemento plataformas distribuidas de misión crítica donde el fallo y el downtime no son tolerables.
      </p>

      <!-- Spec Metrics -->
      <div class="spec-grid">
        <div class="spec-box">
          <span class="spec-label">Sovereign Scale</span>
          <div class="spec-value">4M+</div>
          <div class="spec-sub">Usuarios en Chivo Wallet</div>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-box">
          <span class="spec-label">Distributed Cluster</span>
          <div class="spec-value">300+</div>
          <div class="spec-sub">Microservicios en Azure K8s</div>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-box">
          <span class="spec-label">Throughput Peak</span>
          <div class="spec-value">100K+</div>
          <div class="spec-sub">Req/segundo en concurrencia</div>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-box">
          <span class="spec-label">Production Tenure</span>
          <div class="spec-value">15+</div>
          <div class="spec-sub">Años en sistemas distribuidos</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Mission Cases -->
    <section>
      <div class="section-title-wrap">
        <h2 class="section-title">
          <span class="section-num">01 //</span>
          Sistemas de Misión Crítica
        </h2>
        <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-dim);">VERIFIED ARCHITECTURE</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Case 1: Chivo -->
      <article class="dossier-card">
        <div class="dossier-header">
          <div>
            <div class="dossier-code">DOSSIER #001 // NATIONAL LEGAL TENDER LEDGER</div>
            <h3 class="dossier-name">Chivo Wallet — Core Banking & Ledger</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="dossier-tags">
            <span class="dossier-tag">Bitcoin Core</span>
            <span class="dossier-tag">Idempotent Settlement</span>
            <span class="dossier-tag">Fintech Sovereign</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dossier-body">
          <div class="dossier-text">
            <p>
              Diseño e implementación de la arquitectura del backend de atención al cliente y liquidación bancaria para el ecosistema de moneda de curso legal de El Salvador. 
            </p>
            <p>
              Garantía de idempotencia transaccional y reconciliación financiera en tiempo real entre Bitcoin Lightning Network y el sistema bancario nacional, procesando millones de transferencias con trazabilidad auditable absoluta.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="dossier-specs-box">
            <div class="spec-line"><span class="spec-k">Alcance:</span> <span class="spec-v">4,000,000+ ciudadanos</span></div>
            <div class="spec-line"><span class="spec-k">Rol:</span> <span class="spec-v">Backend Systems Lead</span></div>
            <div class="spec-line"><span class="spec-k">SLA Transaccional:</span> <span class="spec-v">Zero Loss / Idempotente</span></div>
            <div class="spec-line"><span class="spec-k">Integración:</span> <span class="spec-v">Lightning & Fiat Clearing</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Case 2: Fenix -->
      <article class="dossier-card">
        <div class="dossier-header">
          <div>
            <div class="dossier-code">DOSSIER #002 // CLOUD-NATIVE RESILIENCE MESH</div>
            <h3 class="dossier-name">Proyecto Fénix — Malla Empresarial</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="dossier-tags">
            <span class="dossier-tag">Azure K8s</span>
            <span class="dossier-tag">300+ Microservicios</span>
            <span class="dossier-tag">100K+ req/s</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dossier-body">
          <div class="dossier-text">
            <p>
              Reestructuración arquitectónica y orquestación de más de 300 microservicios sobre Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS) para una de las entidades corporativas más demandantes de la región.
            </p>
            <p>
              Implementación de patrones de circuit breaking, tolerancia a particiones de red y auto-escalado horizontal predictivo capaz de sostener picos masivos sin degradación de latencia.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="dossier-specs-box">
            <div class="spec-line"><span class="spec-k">Topología:</span> <span class="spec-v">Multi-Región AKS Mesh</span></div>
            <div class="spec-line"><span class="spec-k">Concurrencia:</span> <span class="spec-v">100,000+ req/s</span></div>
            <div class="spec-line"><span class="spec-k">Disponibilidad:</span> <span class="spec-v">99.99% High Availability</span></div>
            <div class="spec-line"><span class="spec-k">Observabilidad:</span> <span class="spec-v">Distributed Tracing</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <!-- Advisory Action -->
    <section class="advisory-box">
      <div class="docket-stamp">EXECUTIVE ENGAGEMENT</div>
      <h3>¿Evaluando la resiliencia o escala de tu arquitectura?</h3>
      <p>
        Asesoro a CTOs, VPs de Ingeniería y comités técnicos en auditorías de sistemas distribuidos, diseño de infraestructuras críticas y modernización de plataformas de alta concurrencia.
      </p>
      <a href="mailto:christian.dulcey@gmail.com" class="btn-action">
        Iniciar Consulta Técnica →
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <!-- Switcher Navigation Bar -->
  <nav class="preview-nav">
    <a href="/preview-aerospace/" class="active">01. Aeroespacial</a>
    <a href="/preview-monolith/">02. Monolito</a>
    <a href="/preview-editorial-light/">03. Editorial Claro</a>
  </nav>

</body>
</html>
